I was the only one on the road, walking with my hands behind my back. This world seems to belong to me; I also feel like I have gone beyond my usual self and entered another world. I love excitement and also love calmness; I love living in groups and also love being alone. Like tonight, under this vast moon, one can think of anything or not, and feel like a free person. Things that must be done and said during the day can be ignored now. This is the beauty of solitude, let me enjoy the boundless fragrance of lotus and moonlight.。。。
